(7480896, 1189727, 172697, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the nice comments and votes! :)<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=170018" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">lei_73</a> <br/> <br/>The black stains on the text are part of the font; I used the High Pass filter in Photoshop to dramatically sharpen the text, so it looks like there''s fresh paint on it!</td>', 'Thank you for all the nice comments and votes! :)  lei_73  The black stains on the text are part of the font; I used the High Pass filter in Photoshop to dramatically sharpen the text, so it looks like there''s fresh paint on it!', '2016-11-04 07:27:34.000000', NULL, 0),
