(7480921, 1189731, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An excellent entry that fully meets the challenge.<br/> <br/>Very spookily done Susan and congratulations on your high score and HM, well done. Youve done a great job of the post-processing to create a very convincing and very spooky poster that would look great outside any cinema, bound to attract the publics attention and curiosity. I love the red font and shadows, the face at the window, the windows themselves the dominant colours its all working together very well. Its all already been said buy your commenters who rightly appreciate a good job well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An excellent entry that fully meets the challenge. Very spookily done Susan and congratulations on your high score and HM, well done. Youve done a great job of the post-processing to create a very convincing and very spooky poster that would look great outside any cinema, bound to attract the publics attention and curiosity. I love the red font and shadows, the face at the window, the windows themselves the dominant colours its all working together very well. Its all already been said buy your commenters who rightly appreciate a good job well done.', '2016-11-04 09:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
