(7480933, 1189741, 56502, '<td valign="top">Great poster.<br/>Your husband should be glad that the flash didn''t fire. Looking into a flash at full power from that distance is an extremly painful experience. You can''t see anything for half an hour after that (been there, done that years ago with a not very powerful flash). Just hold the hand over a flash when it fires at full throttle - it is hot, that gives you an idea of the energy in a flash. Then imagine getting it into your eyes ...</td>', 'Great poster.Your husband should be glad that the flash didn''t fire. Looking into a flash at full power from that distance is an extremly painful experience. You can''t see anything for half an hour after that (been there, done that years ago with a not very powerful flash). Just hold the hand over a flash when it fires at full throttle - it is hot, that gives you an idea of the energy in a flash. Then imagine getting it into your eyes ...', '2016-11-04 11:26:38.000000', NULL, 0),
