(7480944, 1189696, 109363, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GeorgesBogaert:</b></div><hr/><i> Despite the typos, the presentation of your movie poster is great. Well done, and in my top 3. An 8 from me </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ugh!... the "ie" vs. "ei" typo always gets me ... and i write A LOT for my job... thanks for the nice comment</td>', 'Originally posted by GeorgesBogaert: Despite the typos, the presentation of your movie poster is great. Well done, and in my top 3. An 8 from me   ugh!... the "ie" vs. "ei" typo always gets me ... and i write A LOT for my job... thanks for the nice comment', '2016-11-04 12:15:55.000000', NULL, 0),
